# The window at (-640, -20): headless Ozone's pointer is always at (0, 0), so
# it is over the window (1280 px wide), on the page near its top: clear of the
# window's 8 px edges and of the sidebar on either side, as a person's pointer
# is after clicking a menu item and moving on. A closed menu's sidebar hold
# lets go at once then (SidebarHold::ReleaseWhenPointerMoves()), as with real
# input, and a sidebar no lock holds out slides away (#567).
--window-position=-640,-20
